OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FLacey confronts Amelia. Zane puts
OL,7,     Fpen to paper. David is conflicted.
OL,8,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,9,     FPaula arrives with a worrying skin
OL,10,     Flesion on her leg, baby Noah has a
OL,11,     Fcough that wont go, and Alexander
OL,12,     Flimps in to see Dr Hawche after a
OL,13,     Fmotorbike accident in Vietnam.
OL,14,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,15,     FA new rule that ambulance crews
OL,16,     Fmust hand over patients within 45
OL,17,     Fminutes creates extra pressure.
OL,18,     FAnd paramedics bring in
OL,19,     F67-year-old Dianne, with suspected
OL,20,     Fsepsis.
