OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FHairdresser Blake, 37, visits the
OL,7,     Fclinic to try and get some of his
OL,8,     Fmultiple lipomas removed. Dr Emma
OL,9,     Fdiagnoses a rare form of acne that
OL,10,     Fshe's only ever seen once before.
OL,11,G0000 Britain's Hotel Murders
OL,12,     F...Hotel Murders. A chilling phone
OL,13,     Fcall at a hotel sets off a series
OL,14,     Fof bizarre events. A body found on
OL,15,     Fa bed and a handwritten note point
OL,16,     Fto suicide but police investigate
OL,17,     Fa baffling mystery.
